{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日電車に乗っている時に\nぼーっと外を見ていたのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知らぬ間に「桜」が咲く頃になっていたんだなーと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春なんだなーと、ぼんやりしていました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/03/23/4869483/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握で一緒のレーンだったろってぃと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/03/23/4869483/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握たくさん来ていただいてありがとうございました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Girls Award liveゲストで出演させてもらいました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりこういうイベント大好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/03/23/4869483/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなオシャレをして\n音楽聴きながら\nワイワイしてるかんじ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子ならみんな大好きなお洋服に囲まれた空間!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーっと楽しかった♪\nライブも楽しかった♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回に引き続き２回目の出演でしたが、本当に嬉しいこと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/03/23/4869483/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またよろしくお願いします<(_ _*)>"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ランウェイを歩く\nまいやん、なーちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく可愛くて、キレイで、輝いていて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この子たちすごい可愛いでしょ??\n乃木坂のメンバーなんだよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"て、すごく誇らしく思って見守ってました((笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人とも本当にお疲れ様"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/03/23/4869483/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/03/23/4869483/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな河北さんも見れたし♪\nやっぱ細くて可愛いかったなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/03/23/4869483/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからはもっとたくさん\nこういったお仕事もしていきたいなー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/03/23/4869483/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/03/23/4869483/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/03/23/4869483/0006.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}